 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.19.4",
   "range": "2SA.19.4",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c5491ac5",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.4#p1-c5491ac5",
     "text": "As they do that mourn.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "covered his face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.19.5",
   "range": "2SA.19.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "80712727",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.5#p1-80712727",
     "text": "At Mahanaim.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "house to the king"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.19.8",
   "range": "2SA.19.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "db176f56",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.8#p1-db176f56",
     "text": "Where the most resort of the people haunted.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "gate"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.19.9",
   "range": "2SA.19.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "f65e0d3f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.9#p1-f65e0d3f",
     "text": "Everyone blamed another and strove who should first bring him home.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "strife throughout all the tribes of"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.19.11",
   "range": "2SA.19.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e4866f0d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.11#p1-e4866f0d",
     "text": "That they should reprove the negligence of the elders, seeing the people were so forward.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "priests"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.19.13",
   "range": "2SA.19.13",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b3c7e1fe",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.13#p1-b3c7e1fe",
     "text": "By this policy David thought that by winning the captain, he would have the hearts of all the people.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "room of Joab"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.19.16",
   "range": "2SA.19.16",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "98fd6389",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.16#p1-98fd6389",
     "text": "Who had before reviled him, 2Sa 16:13.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "Shimei the son of Gera",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Sa 16:13",
       "ref": "2SA.16.13"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.19.19",
   "range": "2SA.19.19",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "86fff206",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.19#p1-86fff206",
     "text": "For in his adversity he was his most cruel enemy, and now in his prosperity, seeks by flattery to creep into favour.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "perversely the day that my lord"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.19.20",
   "range": "2SA.19.20",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c57728b3",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.20#p1-c57728b3",
     "text": "By Joseph he means Ephraim, Manasseh and Benjamin (of which he was) because those three were under one standard, Nu 2:18.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "Joseph to go down to meet",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Nu 2:18",
       "ref": "NUM.2.18"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.19.23",
   "range": "2SA.19.23",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0e884b95",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.23#p1-0e884b95",
     "text": "By my hands, or during my life, see 1Ki 2:8,9.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "die",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 2:8,9",
       "ref": "1KI.2.8"
      },
      {
       "text": "1Ki 2:8,9",
       "ref": "1KI.2.9"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.19.25",
   "range": "2SA.19.25",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5cd7efa3",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.25#p1-5cd7efa3",
     "text": "When Mephibosheth being at Jerusalem had met the King.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "he was come to Jerusalem to"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.19.27",
   "range": "2SA.19.27",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "cecfa473",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.27#p1-cecfa473",
     "text": "Able for his wisdom to judge in all matters.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "angel of God"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.19.28",
   "range": "2SA.19.28",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "39123ad9",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.28#p1-39123ad9",
     "text": "Worthy to die for Saul's cruelty to you.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "but dead men before my lord"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.19.29",
   "range": "2SA.19.29",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1ee9b3e1",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.29#p1-1ee9b3e1",
     "text": "David did evil in taking his land from him before he knew the cause, but much worse, that knowing the truth, he did not restore them.",
     "label": "o",
     "anchor": "land"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.19.35",
   "range": "2SA.19.35",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "37925e8b",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.35#p1-37925e8b",
     "text": "He thought it was not fitting to receive benefits from him to whom he was not able to do service again.",
     "label": "p",
     "anchor": "burden unto my lord the king"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.19.37",
   "range": "2SA.19.37",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "60d1fe70",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.37#p1-60d1fe70",
     "text": "My son.",
     "label": "q",
     "anchor": "Chimham"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.19.40",
   "range": "2SA.19.40",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "7b82b4c8",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.40#p1-c944db51",
     "text": "Where the tribe of Judah waited to receive him.",
     "label": "r",
     "anchor": "Gilgal"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.40#p2-7ca99252",
     "text": "Who had taken the side of the king.",
     "label": "s",
     "anchor": "Israel"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.19.41",
   "range": "2SA.19.41",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "85569a31",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.19.41#p1-85569a31",
     "text": "Toward Jerusalem.",
     "label": "t",
     "anchor": "Jordan"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
